<title>FRANCE: OECD - Key forecast by half year - Japan.</title>
<headline>OECD - Key forecast by half year - Japan.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are economic forecasts for Japan made by the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development and published in its half-year economic outlook.</p>
<p>		     1996  1997  1998     1996	1997	1998</p>
<p>		     year  year  year    H1  H2    H1  H2    H1  H2</p>
<p> Real GDP	   3.6   2.3   2.9   5.0  1.2  2.7  2.4  3.0  2.9</p>
<p>(pct change annual rate)</p>
<p> Inflation pct    0.0   0.9   0.8   0.4 -0.4  1.2  1.7  0.4  0.6</p>
<p>(GDP deflator)</p>
<p> Current account  1.4   1.9   2.3   1.3  1.6  1.8  2.0  2.2  2.4</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Unemployment     3.3   3.2   3.1   3.4  3.3  3.3  3.2  3.2  3.1</p>
<p>(pct of labour force)</p>
</text>
